  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "Tńg去南投阿媽ê厝hit兩工"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">作者：</span><span style=\"font-size: large; font-weight: bold;\">張芸瑄</span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">（作者是高雄市中山國中ê學生，指導老師是黃明勝）</span></p><p><br /></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">人講：「樹頭若無根，風吹就倒。」雖bóng tsit-má tī都市讀冊，不而過逐擺放假，我總--是ài tńg去南投阿媽ê厝，因為hit爿有我ê根，mā有我上溫暖ê回憶。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">早期坐車來到南投ê路，山是青青青，水是藍藍藍，風微微仔吹--過-來tsiok清爽--ê。到阿媽ê厝，伊liam-mi tī門口leh等--阮，笑kah tsiânn歡喜。阿媽泡一杯仔燒茶，koh煮番薯仔糜，配鹹菜，叫我tio̍h-ài食hōo飽。「粗菜便飯，食有飽就好，都市人mā ài食健康！」伊笑笑講。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">食飽了後，我去厝ê後壁面kā阿公tàu沃水。田--裡ê菜lóng青lìng-lìng，看kah hōo我tsiok有元氣。阿公講：「作田看天，做人看心，bē-sái偷工減料！」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">下晝，阿媽tshuā我去溪仔邊掠溪蝦。水tsiânn冷，行tī石頭頂，tsiânn好sńg。我掠著一尾溪蝦，驚kah叫出聲，阿媽笑講：「免驚蝦仔，驚蝦仔就掠bē著，沓沓仔是就好！」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">第二工，天iáu未拍phú光，雞仔叫聲就kā我拍醒。人講，「雞仔叫三聲，天光一半」，阿媽早早就tī灶跤leh tsìnn甜粿，真正是芳貢貢、貢貢芳。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">早頓食煞，阿公tshuā我去田--裡。風又koh微微仔吹--過-來，稻仔搖--過-來koh搖--過-去，實在有夠suí。阿公教我ài按怎khau草，雖bóng是tsiânn辛苦，不而過我做kah tsiok歡喜，伊kā我講：「少年若ē-hiáu想，大漢就ē tsiânn樣。」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">中晝ê時，阮坐tī厝頂nah涼，食阿媽切ê粉粿，清涼koh甘甜。Tsit兩工過kah tsiânn緊，suah hōo我siàu念kah阿公、阿媽鬥陣ê生活。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Beh坐車ê時，我kā阿媽攬leh講：「後擺我ē koh倒tńg--來！」車駛離開阿媽ê厝了後，我koh越頭看，阿媽徛tī門口前、目睭霧霧leh講：「Tńg到厝ê時tsūn，ài ē記得kā阿媽買兩包仔咖啡！」我笑kah tsiânn大聲，心內就leh想講，後擺一定ài koh tńg來阿媽ê厝。</span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgyEqfNAyOR0IbXwAEOOSzq2acCodESxmSdbAFvMPXMNC5ca7J0nhgZyFaoQAtk7COsDYUHXrWd90GQ_e0r7OfQA44ynhvxiVZYyKqJJay4gK8kj-KyAmb1oVgdI1mEL1VlS8F3PcobS2WyeEhc5FKvn5YZBPclgpQJYAf3TGji_3BayDIapJz9cRwkdtAW/s3107/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1374%E6%9C%9F_25.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3107\" data-original-width=\"2221\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgyEqfNAyOR0IbXwAEOOSzq2acCodESxmSdbAFvMPXMNC5ca7J0nhgZyFaoQAtk7COsDYUHXrWd90GQ_e0r7OfQA44ynhvxiVZYyKqJJay4gK8kj-KyAmb1oVgdI1mEL1VlS8F3PcobS2WyeEhc5FKvn5YZBPclgpQJYAf3TGji_3BayDIapJz9cRwkdtAW/w458-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1374%E6%9C%9F_25.jpg\" width=\"458\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a name='more'></a><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj12y7NFrGxp_iwbD4wjiNvHZLWYOvjT-ERtt6Dp4y7FrLT9vG2RAczCNlwvA0xMlIbDlstZToXUBXnsmMzVnTvRXNLvSzHUhzAnBTbfnYHB3Cua0PfZyF-mVlhTNvdm2mc3qRNCiV7qHsV2OZJ1Gv9BCeFNBze4YbVssBz8p50XNzl94xuxYod-C8wjCtX/s640/374%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"640\" data-original